            "review_title": "Review at The Sake",
            "review_text": "Jen_B73\nCronulla, Australia230 contributions\n0\nStylish Japanese restaurant in the city centre on Nguyễn Huệ street\nJun 2026 • Friends\nGorgeous japanese restaurant in bustling Nguyễn Huệ street. After cocktails at the hidden bar in the cafe apartments we wanted some authentic Japanese. The food at the Sake was amazing- every dish was perfect. Highly recommend\nWritten June 26, 2026",
