            "review_text": "カタヤマ\n68 contributions\n0\nA selection of good sake\nMar 2026 • Friends\nThis izakaya has a good selection of sake - from +- to minus - with a good selection of fruity, juicy sake on the menu. Some sake is settled in Vietnam. The food is of the same quality as in an izakaya in Japan, and I think even Japanese people can be satisfied.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten March 17, 2026",
