            "review_text": "Fearless45500529167\n6 contributions\n0\nChill Japanese vibes in the heart of Saigon – The Sake\nApr 2025 • Friends\nThe Sake is exactly the kind of izakaya I was looking for.\nSpacious, vibrant, but still super chill — perfect for a night out.\nFresh sashimi, delicious skewers, and sake that hits just right.\nDefinitely coming back for more!\nInsider tip:\nDefinitely coming back for more!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 28, 2025",
